WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.384
Read digits from left to right in groups of three: millions, thousands and ones. A

00:00:05.384 --> 00:00:07.112
thousand millions is one billion.

00:00:07.950 --> 00:00:14.144
Which words name 417,840,000? The answer is four hundred and seventeen million eight

00:00:14.144 --> 00:00:19.861
hundred and forty thousand. Read millions, then thousands, then units: four hundred

00:00:19.861 --> 00:00:23.673
and seventeen million eight hundred and forty thousand.

00:00:24.533 --> 00:00:29.560
A records office at a science exhibition writes “six hundred and six million

00:00:29.560 --> 00:00:33.813
sixty-four thousand”. Select the matching numeral. Pause to choose and explain.

00:00:34.617 --> 00:00:42.140
A records office at a science exhibition writes “six hundred and six million

00:00:42.140 --> 00:00:48.507
sixty-four thousand”. Select the matching numeral. The answer is 606,064,000. The

00:00:48.507 --> 00:00:52.558
millions group and thousands group give 606,064,000.
